It's my turn! - Don't touch! It's that kid's turn!

50
00:03:55,791 --> 00:03:57,333
It was the lady's turn!

51
00:03:58,458 --> 00:03:59,416
How are you Mash Ghasem!

52
00:03:59,458 --> 00:04:00,333
Praise God!

53
00:04:00,375 --> 00:04:02,583
Hey Mammad! See what Mash Ghasem wants with you.

54
00:04:02,625 --> 00:04:03,875
He comes and camps out here,

55
00:04:03,875 --> 00:04:05,125
To catch us red-fisted!

56
00:04:05,125 --> 00:04:06,291
He tells us that you…

57
00:04:07,125 --> 00:04:08,666
He says we skimp!

58
00:04:08,833 --> 00:04:10,000
Little does he know that we ourselves

59
00:04:10,083 --> 00:04:11,041
Catch the whole world red-fisted…

60
00:04:11,166 --> 00:04:11,750
The whole…

61
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:14,000
We catch the whole world red-fisted!

62
00:04:14,041 --> 00:04:14,708
This…

63
00:04:15,333 --> 00:04:17,541
Hold on! You go to people's houses to deliver bread,

64
00:04:17,541 --> 00:04:18,875
