139
00:06:41,333 --> 00:06:42,625
Honestly, Sir, why lie! - Meat for stew?

140
00:06:42,625 --> 00:06:44,666
The grave is this close...

141
00:06:44,916 --> 00:06:46,250
We're not buying meat today.

142
00:06:47,041 --> 00:06:48,083
We wanted to know,

143
00:06:48,083 --> 00:06:49,708
Our Mr. Asdollah-Mirza,

144
00:06:49,708 --> 00:06:50,958
Have you seen him around here?

145
00:06:51,416 --> 00:06:53,458
Lucky for you I've repented,

146
00:06:53,625 --> 00:06:56,541
I don't split people with my cleaver anymore.

147
00:06:59,250 --> 00:07:01,583
Don't tell me you went to my house!

148
00:07:01,791 --> 00:07:03,916
