219
00:09:14,708 --> 00:09:16,791
Gentlemen, I'm at the end of my rope!

220
00:09:18,291 --> 00:09:20,833
I must settle things with this family.

221
00:09:21,291 --> 00:09:23,250
Tomorrow I'm bringing in tenants.

222
00:09:23,250 --> 00:09:25,916
I will rent my house to the rascals and thugs of the neighborhood!

223
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:28,541
