224
00:09:28,583 --> 00:09:30,083
No need to come here!

225
00:09:30,833 --> 00:09:32,958
No need to come here!

226
00:09:33,166 --> 00:09:36,708
Why don't you go to that vile man's house and sit in protest?

227
00:09:37,333 --> 00:09:38,875
Probably he has no time!

228
00:09:39,291 --> 00:09:42,166
Probably busy with another devilish plan!

229
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:45,500
Do you even know that Dustali

230
00:09:45,625 --> 00:09:47,291
Was found by that vile man

231
00:09:47,416 --> 00:09:49,708
And sent home to stir up chaos?

232
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:52,541
Do you even know

233
00:09:52,583 --> 00:09:54,416
That poor Asdollah,

234
00:09:54,416 --> 00:09:55,541
Since last night,

235
00:09:55,541 --> 00:09:56,875
Out of fear of that vile man,

236
00:09:57,125 --> 00:09:59,125
Has gone into hiding?

237
00:10:00,791 --> 00:10:01,625
That vile man!

238
00:10:01,708 --> 00:10:02,625
On one hand,

239
00:10:02,666 --> 00:10:04,916
He stirs up chaos in the house,

240
00:10:04,958 --> 00:10:06,083
On the other hand,

241
00:10:06,166 --> 00:10:09,291
He goes and whispers to that Ghias Abadi,

242
00:10:09,333 --> 00:10:11,333
The deputy inspector, telling him

243
00:10:11,583 --> 00:10:13,333
Asdollah killed Dustali!

244
00:10:13,875 --> 00:10:15,375
If I'd caught him, I'd have killed him!

245
00:10:15,375 --> 00:10:16,125
Quiet!

246
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:19,166
Instead of coming here,

247
00:10:19,166 --> 00:10:21,166
Giving me ultimatums,

248
00:10:21,208 --> 00:10:22,291
Staging a sit-in here,

249
00:10:22,333 --> 00:10:23,875
