259
00:10:37,958 --> 00:10:38,583
Tell us!

260
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:40,791
Honestly, Sir, why should I lie!

261
00:10:40,916 --> 00:10:41,791
The grave is only...

262
00:10:43,375 --> 00:10:44,875
this far away...

263
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,958
We went to buy bread,

264
00:10:48,208 --> 00:10:50,250
That dough-kneader we're not speaking to,

265
00:10:50,875 --> 00:10:51,375
Was saying,

266
00:10:51,416 --> 00:10:53,875
When he took bread to Mr. Shir-Ali's house this morning,

267
00:10:54,166 --> 00:10:55,875
He saw through the crack in the door

268
00:10:55,916 --> 00:10:58,541
